    "description": "Statue, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 182 blocks vs 42 (a paved round 9 across round the 3 x 3 plinth). Flush plaza piece (ground_layer 0: the paving replaces the grass, level with the lawn; the mod's builders can't do that yet). The founding king as a clay soldier in stone, sword raised and shield on his arm, on a stepped plinth with a plaque, in a paved round 9 across. L2 lantern posts, flowering bushes and flowers; L3 a gold-look crown, a red cloak, candles at his feet and banners. Not yet builder-tested: allium, candle, cornflower, dandelion, flowering_azalea_leaves, grass_block, light_weighted_pressure_plate, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall, white_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, sign_text.",
